> 
> /usr/sbin/snmpd
> /usr/sbin/cpq_mibs
> /usr/share/sysman/bin/insightd
> /sbin/init.d/insightd
> /sbin/init.d/snmpd
> 
> Make sure you have the SSRT0612u patch of insightd.
> 
> I didn't replace the os_mibs, svrMgt_mib, or svrSystem_mib.
> 
> After installing these on a v4.0e system, restart snmpd and start
> insightd.
> On the next polling cycle, Insight Manager will be able to connect to the
> system and it's status will go from Inaccessible to OK.
